		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Alabaster tiger construct covered with silver runes. Symbol of power and gluttony. Swallows foes, who enter a pocket dimension.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 18, <strong>HP</strong> 35, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 bite +6 (1d8 + swallow), <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> +5, <strong>D</strong> +1, <strong>C</strong> +4, <strong>I</strong> -3, <strong>W</strong> +1, <strong>Ch</strong> -3, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 7</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Construct</strong>. Only damaged by adamantine or magical sources.</p><p></p><p><strong>Swallow</strong>. On a natural attack roll of 18-20, target is swallowed. Total darkness inside, airless, target starts suffocating. Taotieh regurgitates all swallowed if reduced to 0 HP.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
